{"id":"1928747456914515370","kind":"article","title":"内隐提取练习","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zQGck6tJtxXKa79HWtsV9LT"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2025-07-17","updated":"2025-09-08","votes":12,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":422,"keywords":["检索练习","内隐提取","学习判断","记忆巩固","概念图"],"summary":"条目将“内隐提取练习”定义为在其他活动中不易察觉地发生的提取，并指出其能否达到外显检索练习的同等效果仍不清楚。作者以延迟学习判断的研究提出两种可能：学习判断并不包含内隐提取，或内隐提取效果较弱，并留下概念图是否涉及内隐提取的问题。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1928747456914515370","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"49sFuTBG\">在进行其他（可能更具真实情境性）的活动时，以一种不易察觉的方式发生的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zXA8c6XtMLgRCGwJFGnZUvw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">提取练习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。目前尚不清楚，这种练习方式是否以及在何种场景下，能产生与外显提取练习相同的效果。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"7Ku2lryO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zTdKd8YdaLP9XWmRUWcCfBN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tekin, E., &amp; Roediger, H. L. (2021) 在《元认知与学习》上发表的《延迟学习判断对记忆保持的影响》</a>一文发现，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4uqS1yRWtoe1hE5xuyFSfA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习判断</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>对记忆的巩固效果弱于外显提取练习。这或许可以证明：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4uqS1yRWtoe1hE5xuyFSfA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习判断</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>不包含内隐提取过程，或者，内隐提取的效果本就逊于外显提取。</li><li data-pid=\"enpgOdW0\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3J3QxG3TkZfqkKWTx9cBvi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"w4lfU2La\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1929183552462882287\" href=\"#/post/1929183552462882287\">学习判断</a></li><li data-pid=\"Oo8h40Jj\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1929183905371619597\" href=\"#/post/1929183905371619597\">绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"Yu6lrJBQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-2.5-pro，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zQGck6tJtxXKa79HWtsV9LT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Implicit retrieval practice</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 提取练习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1928747840647168044\" href=\"#/post/1928747840647168044\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 学习判断 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1929183552462882287\" href=\"#/post/1929183552462882287\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1929183905371619597\" href=\"#/post/1929183905371619597\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"1928747840647168044","title":"提取练习","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"1929183552462882287","title":"学习判断","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"1929183905371619597","title":"绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1979846755966276606","title":"学会如何学习","author":"Neel Nanda","votes":521,"minutes":17,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「检索练习」· Neel Nanda"}],"rec_answers":[]}